8974506_1736749073566665_106427629991459597_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j1Bap6tjO0oQ7kNvwE3kuiR&_nc_oc=Adkmy1d2gZIg1R0BHTbu7Ti3M6fPeUemvWAQxNL7nhBD5g6Urj47KTXhoR95kZr7S8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfswiNYpxNmZP3MrfymPgHuyHhxbtg9Q5YS1CZ7F_lbgtA&oe=69A81BAD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MonkeyVerse REDO", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**MonkeyVerse REDO** is a mix of a social and adventure experience with a whole Multiverse aspect of the game or should i say.. a whole **MonkeyVerse!** with 3 Maps at launch of 3 Different Horrors and Versions of the experience, with different and unique graphics and updated tech! This experience is just waiting for players to dive in and check out! **MonkeyVerse REDO,** A Whole Multiverse waiting for you!\n\n# **Gameplay**\n\n**All Movement comes from the swing of your arms and hands with a bunch of cosmetics and maps to explore with a horror mode that has a bunch of monsters chasing you and each horror mode level has different objectives to do to continue the journey into horror, and there's also Multiplayer with synced mouth movement and private codes and also public lobbies to make friends!**\n\n", "short_description": "MonkeyVerse REDO is a mix of a social and adventure experience with a whole Multiverse aspect of the game or should i say.. a whole MonkeyVerse! with 3 Maps at launch of 3 Different Horrors and Versions of the experience, with different and unique graphics and updated tech! This experience is just waiting for players to dive in and check out! MonkeyVerse REDO, A Whole Multiverse waiting for you!"}]}, "developer_name": "The Landons Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/e09fd7a5-8b3e-4ce8-8964-03c95d65cd9a", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jon Landon", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/thelandonsstudio